OL,3,GNEWSAFifteen new members in Isle of Man
OL,4,Ageneral election
OL,5,
OL,6,FFifteen new members have been elected
OL,7,Fin the 2026 general election, with
OL,8,Fthree members of the council of
OL,9,Fministers losing their seats.
OL,11,FThe outgoing enterprise minister Tim
OL,12,FJohnston, education, sport and culture
OL,13,Fminister Daphne Caine and environment,
OL,14,Ffood and agriculture minister Clare
OL,15,FBarber have all lost their seats in the
OL,16,FHouse of Keys.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
