OL,3,GNEWSAFifteen new members in Isle of Man
OL,4,Ageneral election
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer infrastructure minister Michelle
OL,7,FHaywood, former health and social care
OL,8,Fminister Lawrie Hooper, former
OL,9,Feducation, sport and culture minister
OL,10,Fand deputy speaker of the house Ann
OL,11,FCorlett were also among the seven
OL,12,Foutgoing MHks that were not re-elected.
OL,14,FIn the western constituency of Glenfaba
OL,15,Fand Peel, Daniel Davison said it was
OL,16,F"surreal" to be the youngest ever MHK
OL,17,Fto be elected in Manx politics at the
OL,18,Fage of 18.
